                                "sense_id": "2bf2844a-4209-306a-8996-d8d806f99704",
                                "text": "In discussing the clinical aspect of this disease, Deaver's classification has been followed (clinically), namely , (1) ultrasevere, (2) severe, and (3) subacute."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f3cac736-7446-4f95-9495-d2ab3fc29831",
                                "sense_id": "2bf2844a-4209-306a-8996-d8d806f99704",
                                "text": "The ultrasevere cases should as a tule be operated upon without unnecessary delay."
